      "status": "resolved",
      "disposition": "accepted_fixed",
      "summary": "Ordinary store opening could create, migrate, or change journal mode before custody denial. The selected opener now uses dedicated read-only/no-create opening, held-file header checks, early custody revalidation, and unchanged-file rejection tests.",
